WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.840
Yingzong was released by the Oirats and returned to his country, finally arriving back in the capital.

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:09.720
The carriage slowly drove through the city gate, and Yingzong looked at the familiar streets with mixed feelings.

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:14.080
But his younger brother, Emperor Daizong, was still on the throne, and the atmosphere at court was very tense.

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:19.720
When the two brothers met, they nodded to each other, with a trace of awkwardness in the air.

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:24.560
In the year 1457, Shi Heng, Xu Youzhen, and others took action late at night.

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:30.200
Snowflakes fell quietly, and footsteps echoed softly in the long corridor.

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:34.240
They brought Yingzong before the palace gate, and the Duomen Coup took place.

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:39.440
The palace gate opened fully, and the morning light fell on Yingzong's yellow dragon robe.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:45.720
Yingzong ascended the throne and took power again, and the situation at court changed greatly overnight.

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:51.280
The loyal minister Yu Qian was unfortunately killed, and the people quietly remembered him in the snow.

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:56.840
White lanterns swayed in the snow, as if telling the story of the loyal minister.
